<title>USA: ShopKo to take Q1 charge of $1.6-$2.0 mln.</title>
<headline>ShopKo to take Q1 charge of $1.6-$2.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>ShopKo Stores Inc said Thursday it expects a one-time after-tax charge of $1.6-$2.0 million in its fiscal first quarter, begun February 23, to cover costs associated with the termination of its merger with Phar-Mor Inc.</p>
<p>The two companies cancelled the $1 billion merger Wednesday.</p>
<p>ShopKo said in a statement announcing the charge that the merger transaction as contemplated was not in the best interests of its shareholders.</p>
</text>
